sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser (SPA + MSAL)
  participant E as Microsoft Entra ID
  participant A as SmartServe.Api
  Note over B: auth.ts builds PublicClientApplication<br/>authority login.microsoftonline.com/{tenant}<br/>cache: sessionStorage
  U->>B: Open portal
  B->>B: MsalAuthenticationTemplate checks for an account
  alt No account yet
    B->>E: loginRedirect(scope = api://{api-client-id}/access_as_user)
    U->>E: Sign in (SPA pre-authorized on the API, no consent prompt)
    E-->>B: Redirect back with authorization code (PKCE) → tokens
  end
  B->>E: acquireTokenSilent(scope)
  alt Silent renewal needs interaction
    E-->>B: InteractionRequiredAuthError
    B->>E: acquireTokenRedirect(scope)
  end
  E-->>B: Access token (JWT, v2, aud = API client ID, roles claim)
  B->>A: GET /api/requests + Authorization: Bearer
  A->>E: Fetch signing keys / metadata (Microsoft.Identity.Web)
  A->>A: Validate issuer, audience, signature, lifetime, then evaluate policies
  A-->>B: 200 OK (own requests)
